From: Muse <30615262+urawazakun@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 14:54:57 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 20/21] Cache: retain stable prompt tips without generated
 tokens

Public form of b0f5867. Origin user two-lines brief; implemented Muse-1, reviewed Sol. Stable prompt-only tips survive alternating conversation lines; CPU regressions and retention diagnostics included.
